# Release checksums of the IP Operations Protocol.
# One line per release: tag, commit, and the SHA-256 of the release's SHA256SUMS
# manifest, as printed by scripts/release-checksums.sh <tag> (see VERSIONING.md).
# A release's line is added in the first commit after it is tagged, so the
# tagged tree never has to contain its own checksum.
# The lines for v0.1.0 to v0.5.0 were computed on 2026-11-09 from the tags as
# re-created on 2026-10-30 (see VERSIONING.md); their contents are unchanged.
